    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d384-a1-a5">

                <pb facs="0733" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg671"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Muzquiz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-03-02"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 2,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>These proceedings being now concluded, let the papers be sent to the judge making
                    the requisition, together with the alleged criminals, Juan Nieto and Pánfilo
                    Bativerres, and likewise the pistol which was taken from the former. I, the
                    first local judge of the second court, so order, signing with assisting
                    witnesses. We certify.</p>
                <signed>VICTORIANO RODRIGUEZ.</signed>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Assisting witnesses:<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Julian
                            Rios</hi>.<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Guajardo.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Next, the sheriff, William M. Cabe, being present, the alleged criminals,
                        Nieto and Bativerres, were delivered to him, together with the pistol
                        referred to. He pledged himself <pb facs="0734" n="672" xml:id="pg672"/> on
                        Ms personal responsibility to deliver them safe and sound to the judge of
                        the Rio Grande district, signing in testimony thereof with the undersigned
                        judge and assisting witnesses. We certify.</p>
                    <closer><signed>VICTORIANO RODRIGUEZ.</signed>
                        <lb/>
                        <signed>F. A. ZORN,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Sheriff Maverick County,
                                Texas</hi>.</signed>
                        <lb/>
                        <signed>By WM. M. CABE, <hi rendition="#italic">Deputy
                            Sheriff.</hi></signed></closer>
                    <postscript>
                        <p>Assisting witnesses:<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">M.
                                Guajardo</hi>.<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Julian Rios</hi>.</p>
                    </postscript>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
